{
  "about": "Shared fixtures for the 3D mascot motion drivers (BRD-001). Both clients iterate every case against design/mascot-motion.json and must match to 1e-6. Expected values were computed once from the spec, not from either client. Semantics: ease(sine) = (1 - cos(pi x)) / 2 with x clamped to [0,1]; sampleTrack wraps t into [0,1) of the period and eases between neighbouring keyframes; blinkScale(s) is the eye scaleY s seconds into a blink (open outside it); blinkWait(r) maps r in [0,1] to the interval; lookToward clamps x, y to [-1,1] (y positive = up, pitch positive = looks up); approach is exponential with time constant tau (tau <= 0 snaps).",
